    "source_scene_file": "scene-026.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 39,
        "printed_page": 38
      }
    ],
    "text": "உமா கண்ணு என்னம்மா?..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s026-d008",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s026",
    "scene_ordinal": 26,
    "source_scene_id": "21",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி — 21",
    "speaker_label": "உமா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-026.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 39,
        "printed_page": 38
      }
    ],
    "text": "அப்பா! நான் இன்னைக்கு நம்ம எஸ்டேட்டுக்குப் போயிட்டு நாளைக்கு வந்துடறேன்!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s026-d009",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s026",
    "scene_ordinal": 26,
    "source_scene_id": "21",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி — 21",
